        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Supermic+more: PDM Bitstream ASICs for Audio Signal Processing]]></title>
            <link>https://armaangomes.com/blogs/supermic/</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">https://armaangomes.com/blogs/supermic/</guid>
            <pubDate>Sun, 01 Sep 2024 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[PDM microphones have remarkable properties for beamforming. By manipulating the bitstream directly at 3072 kHz rather than converting to PCM first, delay-and-sum beamforming becomes simpler and more precise. This project implements these operations as ASICs using the Skywater 130nm CMOS process, with eight designs submitted for fabrication.]]></description>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[clEar: Glasses-Based Beamforming Hearing Aids]]></title>
            <link>https://armaangomes.com/blogs/clear/</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">https://armaangomes.com/blogs/clear/</guid>
            <pubDate>Wed, 01 May 2024 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[clEar is a glasses-based beamforming hearing aid that uses Golomb-spaced microphone arrays, a custom MSMVDR beamforming technique, and a hybrid multi-speaker tracking algorithm to achieve a 71% increase in STOI and 9.9 dB SNR improvement. ISEF Grand Award, CSEF First Place.]]></description>
        </item>
